frac{1}{s-8}-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{s+8} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{1}{s-8}-\\frac{1}{s+8}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{(s+8)-(s-8)}{(s-8)(s+8)}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{16}{{s}^{2}-64}) \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{{s}^{2}-64}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since $L{{e}^{8t}}$ is defined for $s\\in (8,\\infty )$ and $L{{e}^{-8t}}$ is defined for $s\\in (-8,\\infty ),$ we have that $L{\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(8t)}$ is defined for\n\n$$\n(8,\\infty )\\cap (-8,\\infty )=(8,\\infty ),\n$$\n\nthat is, $s>8.$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396826 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396827 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396826 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396828 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396826 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396829 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396826 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396830 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396826 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396831 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396826 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396826 1077 "field-1" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396826 1079 #edb/ref 17592186396831 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396826 1080 #uuid "4e065cee-e495-59be-a49b-48b465530e20" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396827 1081 "\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}+64}" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396827 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396827 1084 #uuid "461b0ac0-5211-5e64-aa63-d08093e5e804" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396828 1081 "\\frac{8s}{{s}^{2}-64}" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396828 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396828 1084 #uuid "a7b6b192-ec4b-5aca-a7e5-b7e2362c242a" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396829 1081 "\\frac{8}{{s}^{2}+64}" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396829 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396829 1084 #uui