o -{2}^{+}}(x+2)=-2+2=0\n$$\n\nand \n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to {2}^{-}}F(x)={lim}_{x\\to {2}^{-}}\\frac{1}{x}=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$\n\nSo, ${lim}_{x\\to -{2}^{+}}F(x)\\ne {lim}_{x\\to {2}^{-}}F(x).$\n\n- Statement IV is $\\text{false}$ since statements I and II are false.\n\n**Note:** The $4$-periodic extension of $F(x)$ to $x\\in R$ has the graph shown below.\n\n![](images/4a/4afcdf86f777b9c7afc8af31b36cde4b80cfe394fd908db1ccd47ef48dff1617.png)" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396888 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396889 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396888 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396890 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396888 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396888 1077 "field-2" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396888 1079 #edb/ref 17592186396890 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396888 1080 #uuid "f2cb40da-a7f4-5c99-8c06-a63a258898b3" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396889 1081 "True" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396889 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396889 1084 #uuid "8755164a-0677-56b8-a14a-88ef64412325" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396890 1081 "False" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396890 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396890 1084 #uuid "fd07ffa2-060b-5390-8c1e-f3fa7f05b91e" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396891 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396892 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396891 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396893 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396891 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396891 1077 "field-1" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396891 1079 #edb/ref 17592186396893 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396891 1080 #uuid "37025846-4756-5f39-9aec-cf0c7c1f7476" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396892 1081 "True" 13194139533469 